# ...except the DXF parser's golden fixtures, which are hand-written, a few
# hundred bytes each, and required by `ZephyrBench dxf-goldens` in CI. Without
# this exemption the fixtures are missing from a clean checkout and the gate
# reports "no .dxf fixtures found".
!Engine/EngineAsBuilt/Tools/bench/golden/*.dxf
# Committed Lisp dimension sweep fixtures (hand-authored per-type DIMENSION
# records; DimFixtureSweepTests imports them, so they must survive checkout).
!Engine/EngineAsBuilt/Tests/ZephyrTests/Fixtures/*.dxf
